{"title": "Daredevil Proximity", "pageid": 28973, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Daredevil_Proximity", "categories": ["Passive item features", "Passive features", "Toggleable passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Generic_Buff.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/02/Generic_Buff.webp/300px-Generic_Buff.webp, /w/images/0/02/Generic_Buff.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/02/Generic_Buff.webp/300px-Generic_Buff.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/02/Generic_Buff.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Daredevil Proximity</b> is a toggleable passive feature that allows the user to make ranged spell attack rolls without <a href=\"/wiki/Disadvantage\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Disadvantage\">Disadvantage</a> even when adjacent to an enemy.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>Your Ranged <a href=\"/wiki/Spell_Attack\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Spell Attack\">Spell Attacks</a> are made as melee spell attacks when you are adjacent to a hostile creature. This effect can be toggled off. \n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Details\"> Details </span></h3>\n<dl class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dd><span><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><img alt=\"Loading Icon.png\" src=\"/w/images/6/63/Loading_Icon.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/63/Loading_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Toggleable</span></dd>\n</dl>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Daredevil_Proximity\"> Condition: Daredevil Proximity </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Daredevil_Proximity_(Condition)\" title=\"Daredevil Proximity (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/94/Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/94/Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/94/Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Daredevil Proximity\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/94/Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/94/Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Daredevil_Proximity_(Condition)\" title=\"Daredevil Proximity (Condition)\">Daredevil Proximity</a></strong>\n<div>\n<ul><li>Your Ranged <a href=\"/wiki/Spell_Attack\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Spell Attack\">Spell Attacks</a> are made as melee spell attacks when you are adjacent to a hostile creature.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by the equipment:</p><ul style=\"list-style: none;\">\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Daredevil_Gloves\" title=\"Daredevil Gloves\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/82/Gloves_Leather_D_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Gloves_Leather_D_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/82/Gloves_Leather_D_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Gloves_Leather_D_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/82/Gloves_Leather_D_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Gloves_Leather_D_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/82/Gloves_Leather_D_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Gloves_Leather_D_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/82/Gloves_Leather_D_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Daredevil_Gloves\" title=\"Daredevil Gloves\">Daredevil Gloves</a></span></li>\n</ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li><b>Daredevil Proximity</b> is toggleable only while the user is <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Threatened_(Condition)\" title=\"Threatened (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/Threatened_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Threatened_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/13/Threatened_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Threatened_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/13/Threatened_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Threatened_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Threatened\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/Threatened_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Threatened_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/13/Threatened_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Threatened_(Condition)\" title=\"Threatened (Condition)\">Threatened</a>.</li></ul>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit rep